TeX Live context collection (ConTeXt and packages) — the texmf-dist data tree
from tlnet snapshot 20260925, without documentation. Binaries come from
Fedora's texlive packaging; install texlive-meta for the whole scheme.

%build
mkdir -p raw
cat > members.txt <<'EOF'
context
context-animation
context-calendar-examples
context-chat
context-collating-marks
context-cyrillicnumbers
context-filter
context-gnuplot
context-handlecsv
context-legacy
